  ],
  "description": "Operating Area: Southern Andaman Seas (Phuket and Surroundings, Mu Ko Similan Marine Park, Phang Nga Bay and Krabi, Phi Phi Islands, Racha Islands, Koh Lipe and Butang Archipelago, Koh Samui, Koh Chang, Krabi National Park)\n\nEmbark on a luxurious maritime adventure with Major Affair, a Sunseeker 90 crafted in 2007. This vessel offers spacious  accommodation for up to 8 guests overnight in 4 lavish suites.\n\nFor day charters, Major Affair can host up to 30 guests, providing an extraordinary experience around Phuket and its breathtaking surroundings.\n\nEnjoy the comfort of its well-designed cabins and indulge in the variety of water toys, including waterskis, wakeboards, snorkeling sets, and more. Major Affair is not just a yacht; it's a floating haven designed to elevate every moment at sea.\n\nWhether you're planning an intimate overnight stay or a lively day trip, Major Affair promises an unparalleled maritime experience, combining sophistication, comfort, and the thrill of the open waters.",
